Section 3— Mental Health
hands from the fight. He says he just ‘loses it and can''t control’ himself, but is not able
to recall what triggers the episodes. His blood alcohol level is minimal and urinary
drug screen is negative for illicit drugs. Which one of the following is the most likely
explanation for his outbursts?','{"A":"Pathological intoxication.","B":"Antisocial personality disorder.","C":"Intermittent explosive disorder.","D":"Prodromal schizophrenia.","E":"Complex partial seizures.\n\nMCQ 3.353\n\nA 58-year-old woman presents to a general practice seeking advice about her\n35-year-old daughter who has just been notified that her long-standing application\nto adopt a baby boy has been approved. However, her daughter and son-in-law\nhave insisted that the adoption is to be kept a secret within the family and that they\nwill never inform their child that he has been adopted. Which one of the following\nwould be the most appropriate advice to give to the prospective grandmother at\nthis time?\n\nA. As her daughter is not your patient, you cannot comment about her decision on\nthe grounds of confidentiality.\n\nB. Confirm that children who are told they are adopted will suffer lifelong shame and\nrejection.\n\nC. It is the parents’ responsibility alone to decide whether or not to inform the child,\nand it is none of the grandmother''s business.\n\nD. Inform her that once the child starts school, the child has an absolute right under\nFreedom of Information legislation to be informed, irrespective of what the parents\nwant.\n\nE. Encourage her to talk further with her daughter and son-in-law and to involve\nfamily support services before reaching a final decision.\n\nMCQ 3.354\n\nDelta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) is the primary psychoactive component of\ncannabis (marijuana). Which one of the following statements concerning the relationship\nbetween hydroponically grown cannabis and THC is"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.353","duplicate_group_id":"exact-c65d12c5df60","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"85737919f4e407c4693f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":374,"source_qid":"3.353"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"85737919f4e407c4693f","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":374,"source_qid":"3.353","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"Ausiralian Medical Council\nSection 3— Mental Health\nhands from the fight. He says he just ‘loses it and can''t control’ himself, but is not able\nto recall what triggers the episodes. His blood alcohol level is minimal and urinary\ndrug screen is negative for illicit drugs. Which one of the following is the most likely\nexplanation for his outbursts?","options":{"A":"Pathological intoxication.","B":"Antisocial personality disorder.","C":"Intermittent explosive disorder.","D":"Prodromal schizophrenia.","E":"Complex partial seizures.\n\nMCQ 3.353\n\nA 58-year-old woman presents to a general practice seeking advice about her\n35-year-old daughter who has just been notified that her long-standing application\nto adopt a baby boy has been approved. However, her daughter and son-in-law\nhave insisted that the adoption is to be kept a secret within the family and that they\nwill never inform their child that he has been adopted. Which one of the following\nwould be the most appropriate advice to give to the prospective grandmother at\nthis time?\n\nA. As her daughter is not your patient, you cannot comment about her decision on\nthe grounds of confidentiality.\n\nB. Confirm that children who are told they are adopted will suffer lifelong shame and\nrejection.\n\nC. It is the parents’ responsibility alone to decide whether or not to inform the child,\nand it is none of the grandmother''s business.\n\nD. Inform her that once the child starts school, the child has an absolute right under\nFreedom of Information legislation to be informed, irrespective of what the parents\nwant.\n\nE. Encourage her to talk further with her daughter and son-in-law and to involve\nfamily support services before reaching a final decision.\n\nMCQ 3.354\n\nDelta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) is the primary psychoactive component of\ncannabis (marijuana). Which one of the following statements concerning the relationship\nbetween hydroponically grown cannabis and THC is"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["drug","screen"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"c65d12c5df60736b7b1c04e7d79d106e7040d7d0","duplicate_group_id":"exact-c65d12c5df60","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"85737919f4e407c4693f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":374,"source_qid":"3.353"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evide