cholesterol and asks you for information about the cholesterol content of a variety of
foods. Which one of the following foods contains the most cholesterol?','{"A":"Peanut butter.","B":"Yoghurt.","C":"Coconut oil.","D":"Avocado.","E":"Vegemite®.\nnets\nMCQ 3.385\n\nA high rate of blindness secondary to Chlamydia trachomatis has been identified in\nan Indigenous community. Which one of the following measures is most likely to be\neffective in reducing the prevalence of trachoma in this community?\n\n. Eradication of mosquitoes.\n\nRegular face and hand washing.\n\n. Avoidance of community bathing.\n\nEnhanced routine childhood immunisation.\n\nUniversal prophylactic tetracycline.\nee nenenessesennesennnent\nMCQ 3.386\n\nMOORP>\n\nWhich one of the following is the best method of evaluating the effectiveness of a\npreventive intervention that could be included in a periodic health check?\n\nCase control study.\n\nCase report.\n\n. Cohort study.\n\nDescriptive study.\n\nRandomised controlled trial.\nsenses\nMCQ 3.387\n\nMOQOR>\n\nA new screening procedure has been proposed for a congenital disease. Which\none of the following is the most important criterion for accepting this as a primary\nscreening procedure in actual practice?"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.383","duplicate_group_id":"exact-35f06a6ec7e7","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"a6712c6c307b33d2a86e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":386,"source_qid":"3.383"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"a6712c6c307b33d2a86e","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_