A 25-year-old mission worker presents for travel advice against amoebiasis. He will be
stationed in a tropical African rural mission for a three-month period. Which one of the
following would be the most appropriate advice?','{"A":"Avoid eating uncooked vegetables or drinking unboiled water.","B":"Metronizadole from arrival until return.","C":"Ciprofloxacin from arrival until return.","D":"Avoid eating pork.","E":"Avoid eating beef.\n\nseeceaanun esses tSUUNSS 2005s sift P S082 SS SSS SS SS SSS sSSSSSSTSASSESSSNSSEOS\n\nMCQ 3.404\n\nA 30-year-old man is about to travel to South and Central America on holiday and\nasks for advice for prevention of yellow fever. Which one of the following is the most\nappropriate advice?\n\nA. A single vaccination is protective for 10 years.\n\nB. Care with faecaloral hygiene is protective.\n\nC. Boiling all water before drinking is protective.\n\nD. Chemoprophylaxis with doxycycline is protective.\n\nE. Avoiding swimming or wading in fresh water streams is protective.\n\nMCQ 3.405\n\nA 30-year-old Christian mission worker presents as he is about to serve a term in central\nAfrica. He wishes advice about prevention of contracting schistosomiasis (bilharziasis) .\nWhich one of the following would be the most appropriate advice?\n\nAvoid eating beef.\n\nAvoid paddling or swimming in streams.\n\n. Use mosquito repellent and sleeping nets.\n. Avoid eating freshwater fish.\n\nAvoid eating pork.\n\nTTMOQOP>\n\nAustralian Medical Council"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.402","duplicate_group_id":"exact-b9ded519ac00","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"ecee77233ddabffd2e55","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":391,"source_qid":"3.402"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verifi