Which one of the following demographic variables recorded in the patient''s clinical
record has the highest predictive value for the patient''s increased risk of cardiovascular
disease and diabetes?','{"A":"Number of family members.","B":"Ethnic background.","C":"Occupation.","D":"Low educational level.","E":"Residential locality.\nMCQ 3.410\nWhich one of the patterns\nof inheritance shown in the\naccompanyingillustrationis most\na likely to produce the following\npedigree pattern?\n[Affected individuals are shown\n2 marked as solid circles (females)\nio) or squares (males) respectively.\ne Non-affected individuals are\ng marked as open circles or\nsquares].\nA. Autosomal dominant.\nts B. Autosomal recessive.\nC. X-linked recessive.\nD. Polygenic or multifactorial.\nE. Mitochondrial.\nz MCQ 3.411\nA 33-year-old married man with three children, working as a mechanic, presents saying\n= that he has a lifelong conviction that he is a woman trapped in a man''s body. He\nrequests referral for gender reassignment surgery. There is no evidence of psychiatric\ndisorder. Which one of the following is the most appropriate advice?\nA. Surgery carried out as part of a comprehensive program reduces gender dysphoria\nin the majority of patients.\nB. Only non-genital cosmetic surgery can be offered in Australia.\nC. All forms of gender reassignment surgery are banned in Australia.\nD. You are legally obliged to inform his wife if you refer him to a program.\nE. Cognitive behavioural therapy is effective in reversing the conviction of belonging\nto the opposite sex.\n375"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.409","duplicate_group_id":"exact-a432e0ed3046","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"e378de33d42fabcd4419","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":393,"source_qid":"3.409"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser