abdominal aortic aneurysm as an incidental
finding. You tell the patient that he needs
surgery for treatment of his aneurysm. He
wants to know how dangerous it could be if
he does not have the surgery. Which one of
the following is the mortality rate of a
ruptured abdominal aortic aneurysm?','{"A":"A 10%.","B":"RB 25%.","C":"Cc | 30%.","D":"D 80%.","E":"100%."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[200],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-7ed45797a36b","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"656e07b5fe8ac055668b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_page":200,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"a612b5037128316fd499","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":49,"source_qid":"260"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"656e07b5fe8ac055668b","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":200,"supporting_pages":[200],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Cardiology","stem":"You are called to see a 58-year-old patient,\nwho has presented with complaints of\nweakness and shortness of breath. A blood\ntest reveals hemoglobin of 85 g/L (120-160).\nAs a part of the workup for finding the cause\nof his anemia, an abdominal CT scan is\nperformed showing a 10.5 cm infra-renal\nabdominal aortic aneurysm as an incidental\nfinding. You tell the patient that he needs\nsurgery for treatment of his aneurysm. He\nwants to know how dangerous it could be if\nhe does not have the surgery. Which one of\nthe following is the mortality rate of a\nruptured abdominal aortic aneurysm?","options":{"A":"A 10%.","B":"RB 25%.","C":"Cc | 30%.","D":"D 80%.","E":"100%."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"curren